# SSA payment backend environment

Set these values in the Firebase Functions runtime environment. Do not commit real secrets.

MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster>/<database>?retryWrites=true&w=majority
MONGODB_DB=spark_stack_academy

MPESA_ENV=sandbox
MPESA_CONSUMER_KEY=<Daraja consumer key>
MPESA_CONSUMER_SECRET=<Daraja consumer secret>
MPESA_SHORTCODE=<paybill or till shortcode>
MPESA_PASSKEY=<Daraja passkey>
MPESA_CALLBACK_URL=https://<region>-<project-id>.cloudfunctions.net/mpesaPayments/callback
MPESA_TRANSACTION_TYPE=CustomerPayBillOnline

PAYMENT_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://phinehas-hashi.github.io
